You can reboot the FADC Moller ROC (havme25) using one of these methods:

Telnet into the console
    % telnet hatsv12 2005
    Trying 129.57.188.87...
    Connected to hatsv12.jlab.org (129.57.188.87).
    Escape character is '^]'.
    -> reboot
- OR -
    % telnet hatsv12 2005
    Trying 129.57.188.87...
    Connected to hatsv12.jlab.org (129.57.188.87).
    Escape character is '^]'.
    -> ^x                      (type Ctrl-x)

- OR -
Use the network PDU to power cycle the VME crate:
  http://hareboot26.jlab.org/
  - havme25 is on switch #1
